Zen Bridge is an independent HTTP compatibility gateway, not an official
OpenCode product. OpenCode and provider names belong to their owners.

No OpenCode executable, worker runtime, or upstream application source is
bundled. The Go application uses only the Go standard library. Container
builds additionally use the official Go builder and a CA certificate bundle;
those components retain their respective licenses and notices.

Compatibility profiles describe HTTP conventions, not an affiliation,
permission to bypass provider controls, or a guarantee of service access.
Use only credentials and services you are authorized to access, in accordance
with their applicable terms. The software does not execute model tool calls.
